WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.740
<b>Note: They are referring to the Broccoli
opening at the beginning of this DVD.
Who came up with the phrase</b>

00:05.240 --> 00:09.410
<b>''Nyo nyo nyo nyo nyo.
Broccoli nyo?''</b>

00:09.510 --> 00:13.970
<b>I believe Broccoli wanted it that way.</b>

00:18.790 --> 00:20.650
<b>It's been used forever now.</b>

00:20.760 --> 00:22.590
<b>Oh, it hasn't changed at all.</b>

00:22.690 --> 00:23.820
<b>It never changed?</b>

00:23.930 --> 00:26.290
<b>It's used in video games too.</b>

00:27.230 --> 00:29.630
<b>It was never re-recorded?</b>

00:29.730 --> 00:31.060
<b>I wonder.</b>

00:33.270 --> 00:38.100
<b>It's like a rule at Broccoli
to use it.</b>

00:38.210 --> 00:41.900
<b>It's cutesy,
so it's a little embarrassing at times.</b>

00:53.660 --> 00:56.650
<b>This is Usada's-</b>

00:57.460 --> 01:00.990
<b>This episode features Usada.</b>

01:01.760 --> 01:06.430
<b>The title is ''romantic,'' and yet
it starts with ''my tummy hurts.''</b>

01:06.540 --> 01:10.200
<b>That's distinctly
director Sakurai's humor, isn't it?</b>

01:10.310 --> 01:13.740
<b>This is when we learn that
Usada actually wears glasses.</b>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.900
<b>A normal junior high school student.
Who decided that?</b>

01:18.010 --> 01:20.740
<b>That was Koge-Donbo's idea.</b>

01:21.250 --> 01:22.910
<b>I thought it would be good</b>

01:23.020 --> 01:26.460
<b>to have her look completely different
from her usual bunny-ear look.</b>

01:27.920 --> 01:31.380
<b>So Usada had some
hardcore fans after this.</b>

01:32.300 --> 01:34.020
<b>From fans with glasses?</b>

01:34.400 --> 01:40.700
<b>I designed her to have homely braids
and a homely school uniform.</b>

01:40.970 --> 01:46.070
<b>Compared to sailor-type uniforms,
those types of blazer uniforms</b>

01:46.180 --> 01:50.130
<b>are rather dull looking
even for those who wear them.</b>

02:03.930 --> 02:08.360
<b>Horn Alien is a mystery to me.</b>

02:15.470 --> 02:18.130
<b>How was it determined
that she liked dice?</b>

02:18.240 --> 02:20.770
<b>Dejiko's bells are round, right?</b>

02:20.880 --> 02:24.750
<b>So I thought instead of round,
the rival will be square.</b>

02:24.850 --> 02:28.720
<b>If it's square,
then how about dice?</b>

02:29.320 --> 02:32.190
<b>It's not like
she's a gambling fan, right?</b>

02:32.290 --> 02:35.420
<b>It's a problem if she's in junior high
and likes to gamble.</b>

02:43.400 --> 02:47.500
<b>This is where we are introduced
to Usada's parents.</b>

02:47.600 --> 02:51.200
<b>Hikami-san said
this was her first male role.</b>

02:53.510 --> 02:55.030
<b>She did all three parts here.</b>

02:55.140 --> 02:56.910
<b>That's amazing.</b>

03:14.360 --> 03:17.420
<b>So she asked what everyone else
wanted to ask.</b>

03:17.530 --> 03:19.630
<b>''Why dice!?''</b>

03:20.140 --> 03:24.230
<b>I think
the director thought that too.</b>

03:24.340 --> 03:25.360
<b>I see.</b>

03:40.960 --> 03:42.690
<b>This is the romantic part.</b>

03:42.790 --> 03:44.450
<b>Yes, it's romantic.</b>
